      "id": "claim_185035ae5eeece9055619359a405033fda86bdf4d5fb573477a7612a4ca8b65a",
      "title": "theta(p) sigma^2(p) is nondecreasing in p for random walk on the supercritical percolation cluster",
      "metadata": {
        "artifact_digest": "sha256:7ca693f41b58dc937f214984f88868ec53cbf2b1ac91190a10e3345bcae72591",
        "artifact_path": "objects/sha256/7c/7ca693f41b58dc937f214984f88868ec53cbf2b1ac91190a10e3345bcae72591.md",
        "bundle_digest": "sha256:cfe6e94ea6520815e3516fbd60cfa6f94788bb7274b9394099dad8fccbdce9b6",
        "bundle_entry_key": "cond",
        "bundle_id": "population.probability-intake-claude-reductions-and-two-lemmas-c002",
        "claim_kind": "lemma",
        "conditions": [],
        "domain": "probability theory",
        "draft": "claude-probability-1000-continue-0907/bundle_003.json",
        "evidence_ids": [],
        "logical_id": "math:probability.percolation:effective-conductivity-theta-times-sigma-squared-is-nondecreasing-in-p",
        "overlay_schema_version": 1,
        "proof_text": "Couple all p at once by i.i.d. uniform edge labels U_e and declare e open at level p iff U_e <= p; increasing p only adds edges. The homogenised conductivity of the random conductance model with conductance 1 on open edges and 0 on closed edges equals a fixed normalising constant times theta(p) sigma^2(p): the effective conductivity per unit volume is the density of the conducting phase times the diffusion constant of the walk on it, closed-edge sites contributing nothing. The homogenised conductivity is the infimum over correctors of the expected Dirichlet energy per unit volume, and adding conductors increases every Dirichlet energy (Rayleigh's monotonicity principle), hence increases the infimum. The normalising constant does not depend on p. Therefore theta(p) sigma^2(p) is nondecreasing. The same argument gives nothing for sigma^2 alone because theta(p) is itself increasing; near p_c the product bound only yields sigma^2(p) >= theta(p') sigma^2(p')/theta(p) for p > p'.",
        "release_manifest_digest": "sha256:6a47bdc28d86e10df75c402ab20e1bd1b8be36962035f07c56f136f2a7f92809",
        "revision_digest": "sha256:185035ae5eeece9055619359a405033fda86bdf4d5fb573477a7612a4ca8b65a",
        "source_id": "owner-probability-intake-claude-20260907:cond",
        "source_revision": "author-checked-private-20260907-v1",
        "statement_fidelity_reviewed": false,
