    {
      "id": "claim_d872789453c08f9a8db15d0be9e0cd2ea9565fcb9844d0e27604816a854697bd",
      "title": "The optimal revealment of iterated 3-majority on 3^k bits decays like n^{-sigma} with sigma in [log(6/5)/log 3, 1 - log 2/log 3]",
      "metadata": {
        "artifact_digest": "sha256:2ed85dfd635d103b7ba6b178a1eed649f13df0c7f51e38b41ac71868410ead01",
        "artifact_path": "objects/sha256/2e/2ed85dfd635d103b7ba6b178a1eed649f13df0c7f51e38b41ac71868410ead01.md",
        "bundle_digest": "sha256:cfe6e94ea6520815e3516fbd60cfa6f94788bb7274b9394099dad8fccbdce9b6",
        "bundle_entry_key": "maj",
        "bundle_id": "population.probability-intake-claude-reductions-and-two-lemmas-c002",
        "claim_kind": "lemma",
        "conditions": [],
        "domain": "probability theory",
        "draft": "claude-probability-1000-continue-0907/bundle_003.json",
        "evidence_ids": [],
        "logical_id": "math:probability.boolean:iterated-three-majority-revealment-exponent-between-0166-and-0369",
        "overlay_schema_version": 1,
        "proof_text": "Greedy revealment: at each level a given child is one of the two evaluated first with probability 2/3, or is the third child with probability 1/3 and is then evaluated only if the first two disagree, which for independent uniform bits happens with probability 1/2; so the probability that a fixed leaf is read is (2/3 + 1/6)^k = (5/6)^k. Influence: flipping a leaf flips the output iff at every level above it the two sibling subtrees disagree, each with probability 1/2 independently across levels, giving 2^{-k}. Theorem VIII.7 of the source for the {-1,1}-valued balanced function (Var f = 1) with n max_i I_i = 3^k 2^{-k} gives delta >= (2/3)^k. Exponents follow from n = 3^k.",
        "release_manifest_digest": "sha256:6a47bdc28d86e10df75c402ab20e1bd1b8be36962035f07c56f136f2a7f92809",
        "revision_digest": "sha256:d872789453c08f9a8db15d0be9e0cd2ea9565fcb9844d0e27604816a854697bd",
        "source_id": "owner-probability-intake-claude-20260907:maj",
        "source_revision": "author-checked-private-20260907-v1",
        "statement_fidelity_reviewed": false,
        "supersedes": [],
        "trust_class": "curated_secondary",
        "truth_status": "unverified"
      }
